Below, three typefaces show sample uppercase, lowercase, and numeral glyphs: Young Serif for headings and titles, Newsreader (with italic) for body text, and Public Sans (with bold) for navigation, UI, and metadata. All served by Bunny Fonts.' height="1586" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/brennan/6abc4d4d83229.png" width="1238"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://brennan.some.pics"&gt;@brennan&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 23:44:16 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>